 MODULE  : MENU2.C
 PROJECT : ADAPTIVE STREET LIGHT CONTROL
 MCU     : LPC2129 / LPC2148

 DESCRIPTION:
 1. EINT0 enters the RTC edit menu.
 2. Keypad digits enter values.
 3. C clears the entered value.
 4. x deletes the last digit.
 5. '=' accepts the entered value.
 6. Fixed digit limits are applied.
 7. BackgroundTasks() maintains streetlight operation.
********************************************************/

